# The build stages need go.mod, go.sum and the Go sources under cmd/, internal/,
# pkg/ and hack/nhexporter (in the main module). Everything else in the tree is
# docs, deployment files, test fixtures and tooling: sending it made every doc
# or chart edit invalidate the `COPY . .` layer and shipped nothing.
